<h1>🚨 New Order Received</h1>
<p>Hello Admin,</p>
<p>A new order has been placed on the {{platformName}} store. Below is a summary of the order details:</p>

<div style="background-color: #FAFAFC; border: 1px solid #E5E7EB; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 24px; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;">
  <h4 style="margin: 0 0 12px 0; color: #111827; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700;">Order Details</h4>
  <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font-size: 14px; color: #4B5563;">
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 6px 0; font-weight: 600;">Order Number:</td>
      <td align="right" style="padding: 6px 0; font-weight: bold; color: #4C4DDC;">#{{orderNumber}}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 6px 0; font-weight: 600;">Customer Name:</td>
      <td align="right" style="padding: 6px 0;">{{customerName}} ({{customerEmail}})</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 6px 0; font-weight: 600;">Grand Total:</td>
      <td align="right" style="padding: 6px 0; font-weight: 700; color: #16A34A;">{{grandTotal}}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 6px 0; font-weight: 600;">Payment Method:</td>
      <td align="right" style="padding: 6px 0;">{{paymentMethod}}</td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</div>

{{> button url=viewOrderUrl text="View Order Details"}}

<p>Please process the items for fulfillment as scheduled.</p>
<p>{{platformName}} System Administrator<br><strong>{{platformName}} Fulfillment Engine</strong></p>
